# Regression: CHANGES C15 — v1-py's '+' appended instead of concatenating.
# '+' builds a new list; ጨምር changes the list it is given (§4.5).
# expect: [1፣ 2]
# expect: [1፣ 2፣ 3፣ 4]
# expect: ምንም
# expect: [1፣ 2]
# expect: [1፣ [2]]
ጻፍ([1] + [2])
ጻፍ([1፣ 2] + [3፣ 4])

ዝ = [1]
ጻፍ(ጨምር(ዝ፣ 2))
ጻፍ(ዝ)

መ = [1]
ጨምር(መ፣ [2])
ጻፍ(መ)
